*** Opening and Winners' matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
*** Elimination and Decider matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Top two teams from each group advance to the Playoffs

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}

